=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note:}** Most of the mobs in {p:Reisenjima} will aggro and some even have True Sight or True Sound (see {p:Reisenjima#Adversaries|Reisenjima}.)
* Travel to the {p:Crag of Holla}, {p:Dem|Crag of Dem}, or {p:Mea|Crag of Mea} and examine the {p:Dimensional Portal}. You will receive the option to travel to {p:Reisenjima}.
* Upon arrival, you will receive a brief cutscene.
* Speak with {n:Shiftrix}, the goblin by the entrance, (you don't need to pay for info) to activate the {p:Oseem} augmentation system.
** **{c=red:Note:}** If you're doing missions just to utilize the {p:Dark Matter Arcane Glyphics Campaign}, you may stop here.
** He sells a {@k} {k:Map of Reisenjima} (50 {p:Silt}.)
** You may also want to grab a {@k} {k:Mollifier} (500 {p:Silt}) for use in the next Mission while here.
* Make your way to the **Etched Rock** at (K-9) for a cutscene.
** Simply follow the path. The **Etched Rock** is at the far end and there is no shortcut.
*** One shortcut does exist, by using {i:Cumulus Masque +1|Cumulus Masque +1|10385} (synthesized from two {i:Cumulus Masque|Cumulus Masque|10384} acquired from a {p:Monthly Adventurer Campaign} or other seasonal distributions). It works as of this mission, and places you right by #6. Get #1 prior to using the item for a return trip (there's no Eschan Droplet by #6), use the {i:Cumulus Masque +1|Cumulus Masque +1|10385}, and pick up the Ethereal Ingress #6 being careful not to get aggroed.
** Make your way to (K-9) to check the **Etched Rock** and from this point forward you can pick up **Ethereal Ingress**. They do not blink when not yet acquired, unlike other teleport points, and most are on or close to the path, with #3 and #4 (the two in the north west) being the only substantial detour.
*** Note that more than the first six exist: #7 is associated with {p:Domain Invasion} / {m:Quetzalcoatl}, #9 is south down the river starting from #5 and has **???**s useful for {p:Geas Fete}, and the other two can't be unlocked just yet.

